---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
 title="About"
 description="Learn about Limber — our philosophy, our space, and the people behind it."
>
 <section class="bg-limber-green py-24 lg:py-36">
 <div class=" px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
 <p class="font-headline text-xs text-limber-vibe mb-4">About Us</p>
 <h1 class="font-headline text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl text-limber-cream leading-tight mb-6">
 We built the studio<br />
 <em class="font-display italic not-italic text-limber-vibe">we always wanted</em><br />
 to go to.
 </h1>
 <p class="font-sans text-lg text-limber-cream/80 leading-relaxed">
 <!-- TODO: studio origin story -->
 Limber was born out of a love for movement and a belief that everyone deserves access to high-quality, welcoming, expert-led classes.
 </p>
 </div>
 </section>

 <section class="py-20 bg-limber-cream-bg">
 <div class=" px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
 <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
 <a href="/about/our-vibe" class="group block bg-limber-tericotta p-12 rounded-2xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform">
 <h2 class="font-headline text-4xl text-limber-cream mb-3 group-hover:text-limber-bright transition-colors">
 Our Vibe
 </h2>
 <p class="font-sans text-limber-cream/80 leading-relaxed mb-6">
 The energy, the ethos, and what you can expect when you walk through our doors.
 </p>
 <span class="font-headline text-xs text-limber-cream/70 group-hover:text-limber-cream transition-colors">Read more →</span>
 </a>

 <a href="/about/our-tribe" class="group block bg-limber-vibe p-12 rounded-2xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform">
 <h2 class="font-headline text-4xl text-limber-brown mb-3 group-hover:text-limber-green transition-colors">
 Our Tribe
 </h2>
 <p class="font-sans text-limber-brown/80 leading-relaxed mb-6">
 Meet the instructors and the community that makes Limber what it is.
 </p>
 <span class="font-headline text-xs text-limber-brown/70 group-hover:text-limber-brown transition-colors">Meet the team →</span>
 </a>
 </div>
 </div>
 </section>
</BaseLayout>
